cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the associated paper (details withheld for double-blind review)."
title: "Regional Specificity of SAR-Based Illegal Mining Signatures in the Brazilian Amazon — reproducibility code"
authors:
  - name: "Anonymous Author(s)"
    # Author names and affiliations are withheld for double-blind peer review.
    # They will be completed in the camera-ready version.
version: "1.0.0-anon"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Code and Google Earth Engine scripts to reproduce the experiments and figures
  of the paper on attribution of deforestation drivers (illegal mining vs. other)
  from Sentinel-1 SAR features using a per-state stacking ensemble (SASE) across
  four Amazonian states: Pará, Mato Grosso, Amazonas and Roraima.
